{
"content_id": "700396",
"reference_id": 203333,
"version": "1.0.4",
"title": "預言的恩賜",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "預言的恩賜",
"language": "zht",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p>正如使徒彼得在五旬節所言，預言是神的聖靈澆灌的結果（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44002017\" data-end-ref=\"44002021\">徒2:17–21</data>；見<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"29002028\" data-end-ref=\"29002032\">珥2:28–32</data>）。使徒行傳提到一些基督徒先知（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44011027\" data-end-ref=\"44011028\">徒11:27–28</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44013001\" data-end-ref=\"44013001\">13:1</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44015032\" data-end-ref=\"44015032\">15:32</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44021009\" data-end-ref=\"44021011\">21:9–11</data>；另見<span>坡旅甲</span>殉道記12:3；16:2）。其中一位先知是亞迦布，他像舊約聖經的先知一樣，通過象徵行動來傳遞信息（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44021010\" data-end-ref=\"44021011\">徒21:10–11</data>；見<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"11011029\" data-end-ref=\"11011032\">王上11:29–32</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23020002\" data-end-ref=\"23020006\">賽20:2–6</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"24013001\" data-end-ref=\"24013011\">耶13:1–11</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"26004001\" data-end-ref=\"26005017\">結4:1–5:17</data>）。他也預言未來會發生的事件（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44011028\" data-end-ref=\"44011028\">徒11:28</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44021010\" data-end-ref=\"44021011\">21:10–11</data>）。</p><p>傳福音的腓利有四個女兒「是說預言的」（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44021009\" data-end-ref=\"44021009\">徒21:9</data>）。使徒保羅也承認，有些基督徒女性具有這種預言的恩賜（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"46011005\" data-end-ref=\"46011005\">林前11:5</data>）。舊約聖經中，大多數的先知是男性，但也有一些女性先知，如米利暗、底波拉和戶勒大（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"02015020\" data-end-ref=\"02015020\">出15:20</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"07004004\" data-end-ref=\"07004004\">士4:4</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"12022014\" data-end-ref=\"12022020\">王下22:14–20</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"14034022\" data-end-ref=\"14034028\">代下34:22–28</data>）。新約聖經中，彼得在五旬節的講章已經提到，無論男女老少都能領受預言的恩賜（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44002017\" data-end-ref=\"44002018\">徒2:17–18</data>）。</p><p>預言有時涉及預測未來（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44020022\" data-end-ref=\"44020023\">徒20:22–23</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44021010\" data-end-ref=\"44021011\">21:10–1</data>；見<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"45009024\" data-end-ref=\"45009033\">羅9:24–33</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"52004013\" data-end-ref=\"52004017\">帖前4:13–17</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"53002003\" data-end-ref=\"53002004\">帖後2:3–4</data>）。就其本質來說，預言是通過講道、勸勉和解釋神的旨意，來分享神的信息（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44015032\" data-end-ref=\"44015032\">徒15:32</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44019006\" data-end-ref=\"44019006\">19:6</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"45012006\" data-end-ref=\"45012006\">羅12:6</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"46014003\" data-end-ref=\"46014004\">林前14:3–4</data>、<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"46014029\" data-end-ref=\"46014033\">29–33</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66019010\" data-end-ref=\"66019010\">啟19:10</data>）。哥林多前書和以弗所書明確提到，預言的恩賜是聖靈和耶穌賜給教會的恩賜之一（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"46012004\" data-end-ref=\"46012011\">林前12:4–11</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"49004011\" data-end-ref=\"49004011\">弗4:11–13</data>），旨在造就基督徒（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"46014022\" data-end-ref=\"46014022\">林前14:22</data>）。</p><p>預言需要察驗（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"52005019\" data-end-ref=\"52005021\">帖前5:19–21</data>）。教會收到關於假先知的強烈警告（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"62004001\" data-end-ref=\"62004001\">約壹4:1</data>；另見<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66002020\" data-end-ref=\"66002023\">啟2:20–23</data>）。基督徒必須按著聖經和聖靈的指示，忠實運用這項恩賜。勇敢分享神的真理有助教會理解神的心意，並激勵人們遵行。</p><p><u>進深研究的經文段落</u></p><p><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"02015020\" data-end-ref=\"02015020\">出15:20</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"05013001\" data-end-ref=\"05013005\">申13:1–5；</data><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"07004004\" data-end-ref=\"07004004\">士4:4；</data><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"11011029\" data-end-ref=\"11011032\">王上11:29–32；</data><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"12022014\" data-end-ref=\"12022020\">王下22:14–20；</data><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23020002\" data-end-ref=\"23020006\">賽20:2–6</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23044025\" data-end-ref=\"23044025\">44:25；</data><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"24013001\" data-end-ref=\"24013011\">耶13:1–11</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"24023025\" data-end-ref=\"24023032\">23:25–32</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"26004001\" data-end-ref=\"26004017\">結4:1–17</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"26013002\" data-end-ref=\"26013009\">13:2–9；</data><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"29002028\" data-end-ref=\"29002032\">珥2:28–32；</data><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40007015\" data-end-ref=\"40007015\">太7:15</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40024024\" data-end-ref=\"40024024\">24:24；</data><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44002017\" data-end-ref=\"44002021\">徒2:17–21</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44011027\" data-end-ref=\"44011028\">11:27–28</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44013001\" data-end-ref=\"44013001\">13:1</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44015032\" data-end-ref=\"44015032\">15:32</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44019006\" data-end-ref=\"44019006\">19:6</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44020023\" data-end-ref=\"44020023\">20:23</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44021009\" data-end-ref=\"44021011\">21:9–11</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"45012006\" data-end-ref=\"45012006\">羅12:6；</data><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"46011005\" data-end-ref=\"46011005\">林前11:5</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"46012004\" data-end-ref=\"46012011\">12:4–11</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"46014001\" data-end-ref=\"46014040\">14:1–40</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"49004011\" data-end-ref=\"49004013\">弗4:11–13</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"52005019\" data-end-ref=\"52005021\">帖前5:19–21</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"61002001\" data-end-ref=\"61002001\">彼後2:1</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"62004001\" data-end-ref=\"62004003\">約一4:1–3</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66002020\" data-end-ref=\"66002023\">啟2:20–23</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66019010\" data-end-ref=\"66019010\">19:10</data></p>",
